Package: h0testr
Version: 0.1.8
Date: 2025-10-22
Title: Hypothesis Testing for Proteomics
Authors@R: person("Mitch", "Kostich", email="mitch.kostich@jax.org", role=c("aut", "cre"))
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: utils, stats, limma, edgeR, MsCoreUtils
Suggests: DEqMS, glmnet, impute, imputeLCMD, lme4, lmerTest, missForest,
  msqrob2, pcaMethods, proDA, prolfqua, QFeatures, randomForest,
  SummarizedExperiment, vsn
Description: Toolkit providing R-based functionality for analyzing 
  non-negative numeric expression matrices. Provides functions to normalize, 
  transform, combine technical replicates, impute and perform hypothesis 
  testing. Also has higher level functions to run whole workflows, as well 
  as function to tune workflow configuration and parameterization.
Encoding: UTF-8
